%S A400878 1,1,3,8,50,311,1012,4382,19164,99785,515279,2559837
%N A400878 Number of halting compressed register-machine programs of total length 7*n bits.
%C A400878 Use the canonical compressed encoding of the register machine U specified in Section 5 of Calude, Dinneen and Shu (2002). Length includes both program and data, encoded in 7-bit characters. Run-time errors are excluded.
%H A400878 C. S. Calude, M. J. Dinneen and C.-K. Shu, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/10586458.2002.10504481">Computing a Glimpse of Randomness</a>, Experimental Mathematics 11 (2002), 361-370. See Table 1 and Sections 5-7.
%H A400878 C. S. Calude, M. J. Dinneen and C.-K. Shu, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/nlin/0112022">Preprint</a>.
%H A400878 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/ChaitinsConstant.html">Chaitin's Constant</a>.
%H A400878 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/HaltingProbability.html">Halting Probability</a>.
%H A400878 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/HaltingProblem.html">Halting Problem</a>.
%H A400878 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/RegisterMachine.html">Register Machine</a>.
%F A400878 The halting probability of U is Sum_{n>=1} a(n)/128^n.
%Y A400878 Cf. A079365 (binary expansion of the halting probability).
%Y A400878 Cf. A100264 (decimal expansion of the halting probability).
%K A400878 nonn,hard,more,new
